EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I've been watching all the bugs eat.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
So far the butterflies have the best
manners.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} They sip very politely.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bütün böcekleri yemek yerken izliyordum.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Şimdilik en görgülüsü kelebekler.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Öyle
nazik nazik içiyorlar ki.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}You like looking at insects too?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
They're fascinating to watch.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} It's
like glimpsing a whole other world!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿También te gusta mirar a los
insectos?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Son apasionantes, ¿eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Es como descubrir otro planeta!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Sen de böcekleri seyretmeyi seviyor musun?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
İzlemesi gerçekten büyüleyici.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sanki
bambaşka bir dünyaya göz atıyorsun!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}When summer rolls around,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I bring
out my net and magnifying glass!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Then I go caterpillar hunting.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Cazar bichos requiere mucha maña.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Por eso me vine aquí:{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ¡tienes que
conocer a tu presa para ganar!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Ce musée regroupe toutes les
espèces d'insectes des environs !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Impressionnant, non ?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Ich bin so stolz auf unser Museum!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hier kann man jedes einzelne Insekt,
das bei uns vorkommt, bestaunen.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Bölgemizdeki bütün böcekleri sergilediği
için müzemizle gurur duyuyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Gerçekten inanılmaz.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿No te parece magnífico tener
todos estos bichos aquí cerquita?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Yo voy comparando con los míos!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Gli insetti qui sono bellissimissimi!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Spero di avere una collezione
simile anch'io un giorno.
